{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEISTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open, living world with a criminal contract system. Choose your gear and team roles with friends, plan your infiltration methods and escape routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.poster.avif?t=1757220874\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.webm?t=1757220874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.mp4?t=1757220874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POLICE ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirens, chases, ambushes, and special police units! Experience dynamic co-op gameplay with role division and tactical depth. Face off against different police forces based on the contract\u2019s difficulty, and use every trick to evade pursuit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MONEY LAUNDERING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legal business is a front \u2014 a laundromat for dirty money. Take control of districts and unlock new properties. The more assets you own, the more ways you have to legitimize your loot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.poster.avif?t=1757220874\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.webm?t=1757220874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.mp4?t=1757220874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city of palm trees and neon, inspired by Miami \u2014 alive with districts, gangs, random events, and turf wars. The aesthetic of <i>Miami Vice</i> meets the voxel style of <i>Minecraft</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snatch Squad</strong> isn\u2019t just a series of heists \u2014 it\u2019s a journey: from hired gun to criminal kingpin in a sun-soaked, neon-drenched city full of danger and temptation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465810?t=1757220874","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/93e9fd87a2d1fd981f49853b5bb72bf90818e8f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757220874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/4730dd0c0cbdf8fefcc21418c83ae33fb95a1d45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757220874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/4730dd0c0cbdf8fefcc21418c83ae33fb95a1d45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757220874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains cartoon-style violence, including shooting, killing, and blood effects. There is no sexual content."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEISTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open, living world with a criminal contract system. Choose your gear and team roles with friends, plan your infiltration methods and escape routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.poster.avif?t=1757220874\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.webm?t=1757220874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.mp4?t=1757220874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POLICE ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirens, chases, ambushes, and special police units! Experience dynamic co-op gameplay with role division and tactical depth. Face off against different police forces based on the contract\u2019s difficulty, and use every trick to evade pursuit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MONEY LAUNDERING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legal business is a front \u2014 a laundromat for dirty money. Take control of districts and unlock new properties. The more assets you own, the more ways you have to legitimize your loot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.poster.avif?t=1757220874\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.webm?t=1757220874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.mp4?t=1757220874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city of palm trees and neon, inspired by Miami \u2014 alive with districts, gangs, random events, and turf wars. The aesthetic of <i>Miami Vice</i> meets the voxel style of <i>Minecraft</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snatch Squad</strong> isn\u2019t just a series of heists \u2014 it\u2019s a journey: from hired gun to criminal kingpin in a sun-soaked, neon-drenched city full of danger and temptation.</p>","developers":["Voxstar Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/58eebf780fef3b41e27d7ad27f05ec5396e54cd3/header.jpg?t=1757220874","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191026,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191026/movie480.mp4?t=1757056424","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191026/movie_max.mp4?t=1757056424"},"name":"Snatch Squad - Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191026/198218912e90c1897720b5469c6257383955229f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757056424","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191026/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757056424","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191026/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757056424"}}],"name":"Snatch Squad","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><